    {
      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "WHY",
      "narration_text": "Both come from the same problem, which is time. Every tutorial I make is built scene by scene, by hand. And every new fellow has to ask around just to get into the tools. If an agent could take on the editing, and a guide could take on the setup, the whole team moves faster.",
